Buildifier's CLI wraps its executable in a shell script. The lint action
needs the executable registered for its execution platform. Backport the
toolchain field from keith/buildifier-prebuilt#180 until its next release.

diff --git a/toolchain.bzl b/toolchain.bzl
--- a/toolchain.bzl
+++ b/toolchain.bzl
@@ -7,6 +7,7 @@ load("//:buildtools.bzl", "buildtools")
 def _buildifier_toolchain(ctx):
     return [
         platform_common.ToolchainInfo(
+            tool = ctx.executable.tool,
             _binary_runner = ctx.attr.binary_runner,
             _tool = ctx.executable.tool,
             _runner = ctx.attr.runner,
